.TH MPVPAPER-WALLPAPER-UI 1 "2026-10-16" "mpvpaper-dde 0.1.0-4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mpvpaper-wallpaper-ui \- control panel for the mpvpaper video wallpaper
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mpvpaper-wallpaper-ui
.SH DESCRIPTION
A small PyQt5 panel for the mpvpaper dynamic video wallpaper:
.TP
.B pick a video
lists the packaged deepin\-livewallpaper assets (read\-only) and the personal
library
.IR ~/.local/share/wallpaper\-videos ,
applying the choice immediately.
.TP
.B add videos
copies files into the personal library.
.TP
.B pause / resume
controls playback without stopping the service.
.TP
.B fix layering
re\-raises the video layer when it hides desktop icons.
.TP
.B autostart toggle
enables or disables the two user services.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mpvpaper-wallpaper (1)
